00:16:37.247 --> 00:16:40.042
Oh, Fry. I love what you've become.

00:16:41.835 --> 00:16:42.878
What I've become.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.339
What is it?

00:16:45.422 --> 00:16:47.549
