00:17:37.558 --> 00:17:40.310
Listen, you! I was born here.

00:17:40.602 --> 00:17:42.896
I raised a cloud of children here.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:46.400
My ancestors came over here
on the sandwich.

00:17:46.483 --> 00:17:48.735
No one can make me leave.

00:18:25.022 --> 00:18:27.274
Everyone out of my body
or the brain gets it!

00:18:27.357 --> 00:18:28.400
He's bluffing.

00:18:28.483 --> 00:18:31.236
No creature would willingly
make an idiot out of itself.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:33.155
Obviously you've never been in love.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.079
Ow!

00:18:41.371 --> 00:18:43.040
Ow! Ow!

00:18:45.959 --> 00:18:48.378
And now, the hand-eye coordination lobe.

00:18:50.756 --> 00:18:53.592
No! Stop that! Stop it, man!

00:18:58.347 --> 00:19:00.432
You've damaged your brain, Universe,

00:19:00.641 --> 00:19:04.686
but no more than a week of binge drinking
or five minutes on a cell phone.

00:19:05.312 --> 00:19:08.190
I was just working my way
toward the medulla oblongata,

00:19:08.273 --> 00:19:10.234
control center of the heart and lungs.

00:19:10.442 --> 00:19:12.736
And if I kill myself, you die with me.

00:19:12.903 --> 00:19:14.613
- No!
- Stop!

00:19:14.696 --> 00:19:15.697
Wait a minute, man!

00:19:15.781 --> 00:19:17.908
I hope Satan has a nice colon,

00:19:17.991 --> 00:19:20.285
'cause that's where
you're gonna be living!

00:19:25.374 --> 00:19:27.835
Stop! We'll leave.

00:19:28.377 --> 00:19:32.464
But one day you'll be eating
a fast-food burger and boom!

00:19:32.589 --> 00:19:34.466
You'll be crawling with us again.

00:19:34.883 --> 00:19:37.636
Ever wonder what makes special sauce
so special?

00:19:38.178 --> 00:19:39.179
Yo.

00:19:57.197 --> 00:19:59.116
Fry! I missed you.

00:19:59.199 --> 00:20:01.577
Did you find out
what you needed to find out?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:02.661
I'm about to.

00:20:02.744 --> 00:20:04.746
Leela, let me play for you one more time.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.039
You don't have to do that.

00:20:06.123 --> 00:20:07.666
I'm still seduced from before.

00:20:07.749 --> 00:20:09.543
Please. It's important to me.

00:20:22.973 --> 00:20:24.600
What's that supposed to mean?

00:20:24.683 --> 00:20:25.684
I don't know.

00:20:25.767 --> 00:20:28.478
I got nervous
and I started thinking about neck bolts.

00:20:29.646 --> 00:20:32.482
Wow! Did you see that vase break?
It was all, like...

00:20:34.568 --> 00:20:35.736
What's happened to you?

00:20:35.819 --> 00:20:37.446
Nothing. I got rid of the worms.

00:20:37.613 --> 00:20:39.364
What? Why would you do that?

00:20:39.531 --> 00:20:41.158
Leela, I had worms.

00:20:41.241 --> 00:20:43.869
I needed to know who you loved,
me or them.

00:20:44.036 --> 00:20:46.622
Well, which of you wrote me that sonnet?

00:20:46.872 --> 00:20:49.666
I did! I think.
It was probably about 50-50.

00:20:49.791 --> 00:20:52.211
But that's how
I really felt about you, I swear.

00:20:52.294 --> 00:20:54.254
I don't know.

00:20:54.421 --> 00:20:57.007
Please, give me a chance
to be romantic on my own.

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.800
I've got a baggie of massage oil,

00:20:58.884 --> 00:21:00.469
I'm gonna give you
my super back rub,

00:21:00.552 --> 00:21:03.472
just like I used to give Amy
when I was going out with her,

00:21:03.555 --> 00:21:04.932
and she always seemed to... Uh-oh.

00:21:11.605 --> 00:21:13.607
Sorry you struck out, sausage link.

00:21:13.732 --> 00:21:16.610
If it's any consolation, my life is great.

00:21:16.693 --> 00:21:19.029
Babes, bucks, I got it all.

00:21:19.154 --> 00:21:22.241
Well, at least I learned
Leela's a lost cause.

00:21:22.324 --> 00:21:23.367
I give up.

00:21:23.575 --> 00:21:24.660
There you go!

00:21:25.369 --> 00:21:26.578
Good night.

00:21:26.703 --> 00:21:29.498
I gotta get up early
to go parasailing with movie stars.